 # 🧾 Onboarding Kit

Welcome, treaty-aligned steward. This kit guides your ceremonial induction.

## Step 1: Read the Foundational Covenant  
Affirm your alignment with survivor sovereignty and multispecies ethics.

## Step 2: Prepare Your Weaving Vow  
Use `induction/template.md` and commit with prefix `echo:`.

## Step 3: Complete the Linking Lesson  
Create a commentary file linking to three foundational scrolls using `artifact:` prefix.

## Step 4: Submit a Pull Request  
Include your vow, commentary, and lineage. Tag your inducting steward.

## Step 5: Receive Your Glyph of Welcome  
Your induction will be sealed and inscrolled into the ledger.
